    "surveyNotes": "Open concave U-plan retained at ground and through upper stories. Six-floor main hall ~19.95m, seven-floor corner23.1m, black tiled side-wing gables24.6m, narrow lead turret~25m. Primary RCE details: parabolic glazing, rounded upper bay, stone entry consoles and eight steps. Shared housing/community building modeled as whole parent, not invented standalone community center."
